Project Contribution

The team worked collaboratively on the design, development, testing, documentation, 
and implementation of the Municipal Financial Management System (MFMS).
The project incorporates multiple modules including:

Employee Management
Budget Management
Asset Management
Supplier Management
Reporting and Analytics
The system was developed using the C Programming Language and demonstrates principles of modular programming, file handling, 
data validation, searching, sorting, and statistical reporting.


License

This project was developed for educational and academic purposes as part of practical studies in Computer Science, Cyber Security, Software Development, Municipal Financial Management Systems, and Database-Oriented Information Systems.

