1. Employee Management Module
The Employee Management Module manages all municipal employee records.
Implemented in employees and employees.
Employee Information Stored
Employee ID
Full Name
Gender
Marital Status
Department
Position
Phone Number
Email Address
Employment Status
Date Hired
Basic Salary
Housing Allowance
Transport Allowance

Employee Features

CRUD Operations

Add Employee
Display Employees
Search Employee
Update Employee
Delete Employee

Employee Analysis

Department Statistics
Top Earner Analysis
Low Earner Analysis
Employee Sorting
Department Search

Employee Reports

Salary Statistics
Gender Report
Department Report
Marital Status Report

Employee File Handling

Employee records are stored and retrieved from:
employee.dat

2. Budget Management Module

The Budget Management Module tracks municipal budget allocations and expenditures.
Implemented in budget and budget.

Budget Information Stored

Department ID
Department Name
Allocated Budget
Expenditure

Available Departments

Finance
Human Resources
Information Technology
Procurement
Engineering
Water Management
Electricity Services
Town Planning
Customer Care
Legal Services

