Budget Calculations

The system can calculate:

Total Budget
Total Expenditure
Remaining Budget
Budget Utilization
Over-Budget Departments

Budget Reports

Total Budget Report
Remaining Budget Report
Exceeded Budget Report
Budget Statistics Report

Budget Health Indicators
Utilization	Status

≤ 75%	       HEALTHY
> 75%	       WARNING
> 90%	       CRITICAL
> 100%	       OVER BUDGET

Based on expenditure analysis.

Budget File Handling

Budget records are stored in:

budget.txt

