Financial Management Systems Development


Acknowledgement

This project was developed by a student group for academic purposes as part of the Bachelor of Computer Science in Cyber Security (NQF Level 7).

The Municipal Financial Management System (MFMS) was created to demonstrate practical application of software engineering principles including modular programming, file handling, data management, reporting systems, and financial information processing using the C Programming Language.